---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Speaking & Workshops | Emon Hossain"
  description="Speaking, workshops and discussions with Emon Hossain on practical AI systems, automation, AI adoption and Bangladesh-focused AI topics."
  ogTitle="Speaking & Workshops — Emon Hossain"
>
  <div class="container section" style="max-width:46rem;">
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="eyebrow">SPEAKING & WORKSHOPS</div>
      <h2>Practical AI, systems and adoption.</h2>
      <p>Relevant formats can include talks, panels, workshops, interviews or creator collaborations focused on practical AI systems, workflow automation, business adoption and Bangladesh-focused AI questions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">BUSINESS & OPERATIONS</div>
        <h3>Practical AI systems</h3>
        <p>How to identify useful AI workflows, avoid automation theatre and design processes with clear ownership and controls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="entity-card">
        <div class="role">ADOPTION & RESEARCH</div>
        <h3>AI in Bangladesh</h3>
        <p>Emerging-market adoption, institutional readiness, local constraints and the gap between model capability and implementation capacity.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top:2rem;padding:1.75rem;background:white;border:1px solid var(--brand-stone-200);border-radius:1rem;text-align:center;">
      <p style="color:var(--brand-stone-600);font-size:.875rem;line-height:1.7;">For an invitation, include the event or publication, audience, format, topic, date, location/time zone and whether the session is public or private.</p>
      <a href="mailto:contact@emonhossain.pro?subject=Speaking%20or%20Workshop%20Inquiry" class="btn-primary" style="margin-top:1.25rem;">Email an Inquiry</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
